Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 16:38:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] ipa: libipa: af_contrast: Keep the Raspberry Pi
 copyright and licence

AfContrast is a port of the contrast detection part of the Raspberry Pi
autofocus algorithm, which is BSD-2-Clause.

Signed-off-by: Jayden Milne <linux@jayd.ml>
---
 src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.cpp | 3 ++-
 src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.h   | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.cpp b/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.cpp
index 9e08f49d..1ac88c79 100644
--- a/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.cpp
+++ b/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.cpp
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
-/* SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later */
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause */
 /*
+ * Copyright (C) 2022-2023, Raspberry Pi Ltd
  * Copyright (C) 2026, Jayden Milne
  *
  * Contrast detection autofocus algorithm
diff --git a/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.h b/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.h
index 371edef5..fcb94969 100644
--- a/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.h
+++ b/src/ipa/libipa/af_contrast.h
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
-/* SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later */
+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause */
 /*
+ * Copyright (C) 2022-2023, Raspberry Pi Ltd
